          1,
          1.06
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día llegó a las puertas un forastero, con un enorme semental a su lado.",
          "en": "One day a stranger arrived at the gates, with an enormous stallion at his side."
        },
        {
          "es": "Dijo que era constructor, y que podía levantar una muralla que ningún gigante lograría cruzar.",
          "en": "He said he was a builder, and that he could raise a wall no giant could ever cross."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su oferta: terminarla en tres inviernos, ni uno más.",
          "en": "His offer: to finish it in three winters, not one more."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y a cambio pidió tres cosas: a Freyja por esposa, el Sol y la Luna.",
          "en": "And in return he asked for three things: Freyja as his bride, the Sun and the Moon."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses se miraron en silencio. El precio era imposible de pagar.",
          "en": "The gods looked at one another in silence. The price was impossible to pay."
        }
      ],
