          1.06
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los dioses se reunieron en el salón para decidir qué hacer.",
          "en": "The gods gathered in the hall to decide what to do."
        },
        {
          "es": "Casi todos querían rechazar el trato, hasta que Loki se puso de pie.",
          "en": "Almost all of them wanted to refuse the deal, until Loki rose to his feet."
        },
        {
          "es": "Propuso aceptar, pero con una condición: la muralla debía estar lista en un solo invierno.",
          "en": "He proposed to accept, but on one condition: the wall must be finished in a single winter."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sin ayuda de nadie. Solo el constructor y su caballo, Svaðilfari.",
          "en": "With no help from anyone. Only the builder and his horse, Svaðilfari."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y si el primer día del verano faltaba una sola piedra, no cobraría nada.",
          "en": "And if a single stone was missing on the first day of summer, he would be paid nothing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses juraron el trato con grandes juramentos, seguros de que era imposible cumplirlo.",
          "en": "The gods swore to the bargain with solemn oaths, sure that no one could ever fulfill it."
        }
      ],
