      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "El primer día del invierno, el constructor empezó a trabajar.",
          "en": "On the first day of winter, the builder began to work."
        },
        {
          "es": "De noche, Svaðilfari arrastraba piedras enormes. De día, su amo las colocaba una sobre otra.",
          "en": "By night, Svaðilfari hauled enormous stones. By day, his master set them one upon another."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses miraban asombrados: el caballo hacía el doble de trabajo que el constructor.",
          "en": "The gods watched in amazement: the horse did twice as much work as the builder."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pasaban los meses, y la muralla crecía: alta, firme, imposible de escalar.",
          "en": "The months went by, and the wall kept growing: tall, solid, impossible to climb."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ningún gigante, ni de la montaña ni del hielo, podría cruzarla.",
          "en": "No giant, of mountain or of frost, would ever be able to cross it."
        }
      ],
