      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Faltaban tres días para el verano, y la muralla estaba casi terminada.",
          "en": "Three days remained before summer, and the wall was almost finished."
        },
        {
          "es": "A la fortaleza solo le faltaba la puerta.",
          "en": "Only the gateway was still missing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces los dioses comprendieron lo que habían hecho: iban a perder a Freyja, el Sol y la Luna.",
          "en": "Then the gods understood what they had done: they were about to lose Freyja, the Sun and the Moon."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se reunieron furiosos, buscando un culpable. Y todos miraron a Loki.",
          "en": "They gathered in fury, looking for someone to blame. And every eye turned to Loki."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo amenazaron con una muerte terrible si no encontraba la forma de que el constructor no cobrara.",
          "en": "They threatened him with a terrible death unless he found a way to stop the builder from being paid."
        },
        {
          "es": "Loki, aterrado, juró que lo arreglaría, costara lo que costara.",
          "en": "Loki, terrified, swore that he would fix it, whatever it took."
        }
      ],
