      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Esa noche, el constructor fue al bosque con Svaðilfari a buscar más piedras.",
          "en": "That night, the builder went into the forest with Svaðilfari to fetch more stones."
        },
        {
          "es": "De pronto, de entre los árboles salió una yegua, relinchando.",
          "en": "Suddenly, out of the trees came a mare, neighing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Svaðilfari la vio, rompió sus arneses y salió corriendo tras ella.",
          "en": "Svaðilfari saw her, broke his harness and galloped after her."
        },
        {
          "es": "El constructor corrió detrás, gritando, y toda la noche los dos caballos se perdieron en el bosque.",
          "en": "The builder ran after them, shouting, and all night long the two horses vanished into the forest."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esa yegua era Loki, que había cambiado de forma para salvar a los dioses.",
          "en": "That mare was Loki, who had changed his shape to save the gods."
        }
      ],
