      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Sin su caballo, el constructor no pudo terminar a tiempo, y comprendió que había perdido.",
          "en": "Without his horse, the builder could not finish in time, and he understood that he had lost."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces se enfureció y dejó de fingir: era un gigante de la montaña.",
          "en": "Then he flew into a rage and stopped pretending: he was a mountain giant."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses lo vieron y lo supieron. Nunca había sido un simple constructor.",
          "en": "The gods saw him and knew. He had never been a simple builder."
        },
        {
          "es": "Rompieron sus juramentos y llamaron a Thor, que acababa de volver del este.",
          "en": "They broke their oaths and called for Thor, who had just come back from the east."
        },
        {
          "es": "Thor alzó a Mjölnir y, de un solo golpe, lo envió a la oscuridad de Niflhel.",
          "en": "Thor raised Mjölnir and with a single blow sent him down into the darkness of Niflhel."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así se salvaron Freyja, el Sol y la Luna. Pero los dioses habían roto sus palabras, y eso tendría un precio.",
          "en": "So Freyja, the Sun and the Moon were saved. But the gods had broken their word, and that would have a price."
        }
